// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2638959663" "What is this madness you speak of? Dr. Aeon was the one trying to stop you? This makes no sense. Lord Recluse will want to know the meaning of this, and I must confess that I am curious as well. Something very strange is happening, and I cannot yet see the truth of it."
// RandomFameString :
"P3599821687" "Why are Arachnos troops calling {VillainName} the 'Destined One'?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2433229930" "A great deal of suspicion has come down upon Dr. Aeon, and I do not think it is without merit. Operation: DESTINY is too great an endeavor to be stopped now. But this must be done in the proper way, lest the revelation of Aeon's interference turns his interrogation into a witch-hunt. Therefore, I suggest that you <A HREF={ACCEPT}>get the support of Arbiter Daos to keep things quiet. Then, go and question Dr. Aeon by whatever means necessary.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4249316673" "Talk to Arbiter Daos, then catch Dr. Aeon."
// SendOffString :
"P63436830" "Once you have the word from Daos, bring in Dr. Aeon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4264124142" "Talk to Arbiter Daos"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1089758906" "Go talk to Arbiter Daos"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3430480431" "This accusation against Dr. Aeon is dire, but not unfounded. And considering your status as the Destined One, I will agree to aid your investigation. {VillainName}, I grant you the authority to capture and question Dr. Aeon. Find out what part he had in all of this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3345008734" "Catch Dr. Aeon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1809655163" "I have spoken to Arbiter Daos, and he has told me that your Aeon investigation has his approval."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1007563710" "Where ever Dr. Aeon may be hiding, you'll find him and get the answers you need."

