// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P152040894" "This is it. If you defeat Lord Recluse here, at his moment of triumph, you can break the cycle of doom. Recluse may have sought you out as one of his Destined Ones, but this moment is your Operation: DESTINY."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P3752041347" "It's over. Time to show Lord Recluse your prize."

